<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp45-comparison" name="04-45. VIA 과거 정보의 Request별 구성과 공통 생산 및 조회"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="0" width="1920" height="1080" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE / DP 설계 비교&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#087E8B;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="22" width="1300" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;구조 비교 / 장단점 / QA Trade-off&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1430" y="22" width="450" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;04-45. VIA 과거 정보의 Request별 구성과 공통 생산 및 조회&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=39;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="65" width="1840" height="50.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="121" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="121" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;“지난번 네가 설명한 평가 기준에 맞춰, 앞서 조사한 제품 비교 결과와 받아둔 견적을 이번 제안서에 반영해줘.”&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="137" width="1840" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;공통: VIA가 실제 설명한 내용 + 제품 조사와 견적의 결과 / 현재 제안서 업무 연결은 해석 결과 / 로컬 VIA + 클라우드 모델&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="168" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=#D5E7C7;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="195" width="1840" height="48" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;A 원본 서비스 조합형&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="156.0" y="206" width="838" height="32.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;B 공통 파생 기억 저장소형&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1026.0" y="206" width="838" height="32.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="1010" y="195" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1010" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="795" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;PARTIAL: 실제 전달한 예외 문구 한 구간과 결과 참조의 예시 / 기준 전체의 완전 추출을 뜻하지 않음 / 과거 게시와 현재 의미 채택은 별개&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="809" width="1840" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;첫 요청 / 준비된 반복 조회 / 정정 직후 / 표현 밖 관계를 구분. A의 유효 관계 cache와 부분 갱신도 허용한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="838" width="1840" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="871" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="871" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;요청 처리 정확성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="877" width="245" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;새 관계를 현재 원문에서 구성 / 검색 누락 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="877" width="720" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;게시 표현과 추출 범위에 제한 / 원본 확인 유지&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="877" width="820" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="896" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="896" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;상호작용 응답시간&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="902" width="245" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;반복 조회도 원본 구성 / 유효 관계 cache로 축소&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="902" width="720" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;유효 게시 재사용 시 단축 / 첫 생산과 갱신 대기&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="902" width="820" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="921" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="921" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA 요청 처리시간&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="927" width="245" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;현재 목적에 맞춘 조회와 결합 / 병렬 읽기 허용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="927" width="720" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;준비된 관계 읽기 / 미생산 범위는 생산 후 재조회&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="927" width="820" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="946" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="946" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA 모델 사용 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="952" width="245" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Request 구성과 cache 유지 / 부분 갱신 비용 포함&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="952" width="720" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;초기 / 변경 / 미사용 생산 포함 / 반복 사용 시 상각&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="952" width="820" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="971" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="971" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA 변경 용이성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="977" width="245" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;조회 지침과 adapter / cache 형식 변경 시 무효화&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="977" width="720" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;관계 schema / producer와 reader 호환 / 재생산&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="977" width="820" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="996" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="996" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;로컬 VIA 메모리 사용량&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verti